Hi Hackers,

let me suggest a major addition to the NetHack sources. How about a level
generator which makes it possible to create predefined levels in a special
level database (format like the save file)?
It would be possible that makelevel() decides to create a random dungeon
or to use a predefined level out from the database. It should also be
possible to link several predefined levels together to build a coherent
dungeon part, e.g. to create a castle.
The level generator should be an interactive tool with menus to choose
the different objects which are existing within NetHack and to place them
to the locations the creator want.
Let me know what you are thinking about this proposal.

>>> Karl >>>

